---
const values = [
  { tone: 'teal', head: 'Honesty',            body: "I refuse to promise outcomes I can't directly control." },
  { tone: 'rose', head: 'Stewardship',        body: 'I build compounding systems instead of rented attention.' },
  { tone: 'rose', head: 'Long-term thinking', body: 'I optimize for repeat purchase, not first conversion.' },
  { tone: 'teal', head: 'Care for the human', body: 'Humans sit at the center of every marketing decision.' },
];
---

<section class="section bg-bone" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="path">
      <span class="num">06</span>
      <span class="label">ABOUT</span>
      <span class="slash">/</span>
      <span>WHAT'S UNDERNEATH THE WORK</span>
    </div>

    <div class="section-h split" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="h2" data-zoom>Carson Poore.<br/>Indianapolis.</h2>
      <div class="head-side">
        <p class="lead">
          Brand strategist. I work with founders launching something with
          real conviction. I think <em>with</em> founders. Not at them.
          Conviction has to be surfaced. It can't be lectured into existence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="lead about-lead" data-reveal>
      My faith shapes the work through values. Not as a niche. Not as a label.
      Honesty, stewardship, long-term thinking, care for the human. These
      aren't philosophical extras. They produce the entire approach.
    </p>

    <div class="values" data-reveal-stagger>
      {values.map((v, i) => (
        <article class={`value value-${v.tone}`} data-zoom>
          <header>
            <span class="vn mono">V{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3 class="h3">{v.head}</h3>
          </header>
          <p>{v.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-h .h2 br { display: none; }
  @media (min-width: 600px) { .section-h .h2 br { display: inline; } }
  .head-side .lead em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; color: var(--warm); }
  .head-side .lead { max-width: 50ch; }

  .about-lead {
    margin: var(--s-12) 0 var(--s-16);
    max-width: 78ch;
  }

  .values {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ink);
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .values { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  .value {
    padding: var(--s-12) var(--s-8);
    border-right: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    color: var(--bone);
    min-height: 240px;
  }
  .value-teal { background: var(--teal); }
  .value-rose { background: var(--rose); }

  .value header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    color: var(--bone);
  }
  .vn {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.7);
  }
  .value h3 { color: var(--bone); }
  .value p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; opacity: 0.92; max-width: 36ch; }
</style>
